# Analytics — optional. Drop one of these into a .env file (or set in your CI deploy env)
# and rebuild to enable. Disabled by default. None of these set cookies; all are privacy-friendly.
#
# Plausible (https://plausible.io — paid, but cookieless and lightweight):
# PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_PROVIDER=plausible
# PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_DOMAIN=ismayc.github.io/sql-tutorial
#
# GoatCounter (https://www.goatcounter.com — free for personal/non-commercial):
# PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_PROVIDER=goatcounter
# PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_GC_URL=https://yourname.goatcounter.com/count
#
# Umami (https://umami.is — self-hostable, also has a hosted free tier):
# PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_PROVIDER=umami
# PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_SRC=https://your-umami-host/script.js
# PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_DOMAIN=your-site-id-uuid
